---
title: "Health — Probes"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant CLIENT as K8s / Load Balancer
    participant API as API Layer
    participant DB as Backend / Database

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% HAPPY PATH FLOWS
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

    rect rgb(200, 230, 255)
        Note over CLIENT,API: LIVENESS PROBE — 200 (no auth, no DB)
        CLIENT->>+API: GET /api/health/live
        Note right of API: Process is running,<br/>no external deps checked
        API-->>-CLIENT: 200 OK
    end

    rect rgb(200, 230, 255)
        Note over CLIENT,DB: READINESS PROBE — 200 (no auth, pings DB)
        CLIENT->>+API: GET /api/health/ready
        API->>+DB: PING database connection
        DB-->>-API: Pong
        API-->>-CLIENT: 200 OK<br/>{server: "ok", database: "ok"}
    end

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% ERROR FLOW
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

    rect rgb(230, 215, 230)
        Note over CLIENT,DB: READINESS PROBE — 503 DB unreachable
        CLIENT->>+API: GET /api/health/ready
        API->>+DB: PING database connection
        DB--xAPI: Connection timeout / refused
        API-->>-CLIENT: 503 Service Unavailable<br/>{server: "ok", database: "error"}
        Note right of CLIENT: Load balancer removes<br/>instance from pool
    end
